Feature: Generic
  This is a generic feature file that can be used to test multiple XML features.

  Scenario Outline: Basic XML SOAP request & response.
    Given That HRMS_Services ( <serviceName> ) service is up and running

    Examples: 
      | serviceName                         |
      
      
      | "WB_createOrUpdateEmployee"         |
      | "WB_getAllLearnerRecords"           |
      | "WB_getDelegateAuthorityPerDate"    |
      | "WB_getDelegateAuthorityPerGrantor" |
      | "WB_getEmpTerminations"             |
      | "WB_getEmpTransfers"                |
      | "WB_getLearnerRecordsSince"         |
      | "WB_getLearnerRecordsSinceUnix"     |
      | "WB_getMyAccessEmpOnLeavePerDate"   |
      | "WB_getMyAccessLeaveForEmployee"    |
      | "WB_getWBEmpBasicAccess"            |
      | "WB_getWBEmployeesOnLeavePerDate"   |
      | "WB_getWBLeaveForEmployee"          |
      | "WB_getWBMasterEmployeeInfo"        |
      | "WB_getWBMyAccessOrgs"              |
      | "WB_getWBMyAccessStaging"           |
      | "WB_getWBRecruitmentDetails"        |
      | "WB_getWBRecruitmentDetailsByID"    |